# Applies to every build whose context is the repo root — Dockerfile.dev (the
# devcontainer) and fake-mychart/Dockerfile, which needs the root as its context
# so the image can carry shared/ alongside fake-mychart/.
#
# Both images install their own dependencies and build their own output, so
# nothing here is load-bearing for either build; keeping it out just stops the
# context from carrying hundreds of megabytes of regenerable files.
node_modules
**/node_modules
.git
**/.next
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Agent worktrees are full checkouts of this repo — including them would make
# the build context recursive.
.claude/worktrees
